import{_ as t,o,c as a,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 265 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Wushuang Academy Alternative: Cross-Plane Mentor Network","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 265 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Wushuang Academy Alternative: Cross-Plane Mentor Network","no":265,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Wushuang Academy","Cross-Plane Mentor Network","Alternative","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["37-Symbiotic Education System","66-Cross-Plane Communication Technology","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0265_模块2-唐罗-无双学院替代方案.md","filePath":"en/0265_模块2-唐罗-无双学院替代方案.md"}'),n={name:"en/0265_模块2-唐罗-无双学院替代方案.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,c,u){return o(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-265-tang-luo-decomposition-wushuang-academy-alternative-cross-plane-mentor-network" tabindex="-1">Entry 265 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Wushuang Academy Alternative: Cross-Plane Mentor Network <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-265-tang-luo-decomposition-wushuang-academy-alternative-cross-plane-mentor-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 265 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Wushuang Academy Alternative: Cross-Plane Mentor Network&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 15)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-one-academy-to-one-network" tabindex="-1">Introduction: From one academy, to one network <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-one-academy-to-one-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: From one academy, to one network&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to have equal evolution qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones to feed back to Myriad Races. Tang Luo&#39;s Wushuang Academy is the old &quot;concentrating elites&quot; model; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is the new &quot;distributed network&quot; model. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, concretely giving Wushuang Academy&#39;s institutional alternative. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Wushuang Academy&#39;s energy-level waste (already described in Entry 255) is re-quantified from the alternative perspective:</p><ul><li><strong>Campus cost</strong>: centralized schooling, students travel a thousand li to attend, travel time, quota screening, failure attrition — civilization annually pays hidden costs for &quot;centralization&quot; far exceeding the academy itself</li><li><strong>Teacher idling</strong>: famous teachers&#39; time is limited; centralized teaching means a famous teacher teaches only a hundred at a time. If switched to recorded broadcast + Q&amp;A, the same teacher can teach a million — teacher utilization rate differs by three orders of magnitude</li><li><strong>Geographic privilege</strong>: the academy&#39;s location becomes the cultivation center, surrounding land prices soar, population clusters, other regions decline. Geographic monopoly itself is new unfairness</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>under the centralized model, education resource utilization rate is under one-tenth of the distributed model.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Centralized academy model&#39;s regression path:</p><ol><li><strong>Geographic solidification</strong>: development gap between the academy&#39;s location and other regions widens generation by generation; civilization&#39;s talent geographic map is locked</li><li><strong>Famous-teacher dependency</strong>: course quality rests on famous teachers; famous teachers retire or die, course quality immediately drops. No-backup teaching system</li><li><strong>Knowledge walls</strong>: inside the academy walls is orthodoxy, outside the walls is crooked paths. The higher the walls are built, the more barren off-campus knowledge ecology</li></ol><p>Regression form: the academy runs better and better, but civilization&#39;s education map gets more and more deformed.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory thinking behind Wushuang Academy:</p><ul><li><strong>Entry approval power</strong>: who can enroll is decided by the academy. Turning &quot;can one cultivate&quot; into &quot;can one be selected&quot; downgrades a natural right to an approval qualification</li><li><strong>Orthodoxy discourse power</strong>: the academy declares itself &quot;sole orthodoxy,&quot; other learning paths automatically demoted to &quot;crooked paths.&quot; This is knowledge discourse monopoly</li><li><strong>Famous-teacher personal attachment</strong>: to follow famous teachers, students must migrate, must apprentice, must obey master-disciple ethics. Personal relations are kidnapped by knowledge relations</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, the academy is the concrete carrier of &quot;knowledge entry&quot; in his predatory structure.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-cross-plane-mentor-network" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative: Cross-Plane Mentor Network <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-cross-plane-mentor-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative: Cross-Plane Mentor Network&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alternative&#39;s complete design:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Module</th><th>Design</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Course library</td><td>All courses recorded and uploaded to Alaya Network, learnable, rewatchable, speed-adjustable anytime</td></tr><tr><td>Mentor matching</td><td>By students&#39; talent and progress, automatically match cross-plane mentors, no racial or geographic restriction</td></tr><tr><td>Practice nodes</td><td>Practice dojos set locally, cultivate nearby, no need to travel a thousand li</td></tr><tr><td>Q&amp;A mechanism</td><td>Difficult questions uploaded to network, billions of mentors and students collaboratively answer</td></tr><tr><td>Certification system</td><td>Cultivation progress certified by Alaya Network, not depending on any academy&#39;s diploma</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Races coverage</td><td>Courses adapted to the five physiological genealogies, strange beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness each have dedicated paths</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s key: turn &quot;centralized teaching&quot; into &quot;distributed learning,&quot; turn &quot;famous-teacher aura&quot; into &quot;network consensus.&quot; Education is everywhere, orthodoxy is everywhere — so there is no such thing as &quot;walls.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Wushuang Academy centralized model</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group B injects cross-plane mentor network</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: total cultivation population within a hundred years, average success age, geographic development balance</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B cultivation population ten times Group A, success age decades earlier, geographic balance near complete</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. The alternative is self-consistent with Alaya Network, cross-plane communication technology and other foundational settings</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: low</strong>. Distributed network model is naturally anti-retcon — it does not need any single-point setting to support</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: after the alternative, dependency drops from &quot;high&quot; to &quot;extremely low&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: raise education resource utilization from one-tenth to ten-tenths</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: abolish entry approval power, cultivation qualification naturalized</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: from one academy to one network is a quantitative-to-qualitative leap</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: cross-racial, cross-plane, covering 99%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: distributed networks naturally support multiverse-tier expansion</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Wushuang Academy is a monument to Tang Luo&#39;s good will; the cross-plane mentor network is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s institutional answer. The crux of the comparison: Tang Luo asks &quot;how to send more people into the academy,&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou asks &quot;why is an academy needed.&quot; When knowledge is everywhere, the academy has completed its historical mission — take a bow.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./37-共生教育体系.html">37-Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./66-跨位面通讯技术.html">66-Cross-Plane Communication Technology</a> · <a href="./21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=t(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
